{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.poster.avif?t=1756837518\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.webm?t=1756837518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.mp4?t=1756837518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the post-human wastes of the distant future, you are dispatched to stop the <i>Finis Omnia</i>, a cult hellbent on tearing open reality to unleash an eldritch horror. Armed with mutative upgrades, you\u2019ll blast, interrogate, and investigate your way through a surreal, intergalactic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, mutating to achieve order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <i>Afterflesh\u00a0</i>\u2014 an intergalactic nightmare of space stations, alien planets, and pocket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult\u2019s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/00b28ed65b21e8f104fdf9405bb4becf.avif?t=1756837518\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","back