cket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult\u2019s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/00b28ed65b21e8f104fdf9405bb4becf.avif?t=1756837518\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Buzzsaw Dreams"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/3ac2ef10b216a529c2276e4a38c75b40cbf95abe/header.jpg?t=1756837518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191702,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191702/movie480.mp4?t=1756754321","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191702/movie_max.mp4?t=1756754321"},"name":"Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191702/7f9e40c1449c7b4c1c56743c29780561aeaa269b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756754321","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191702/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756754321","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191702/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756754321"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257127974,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127974/movie480.mp4?t=1756837514","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127974/movie_max.mp4?t=1756837514"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item